<div class="app">
    <div class="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-header"><h1>📸 Website Image Collector</h1><p>Extract and view all images from every page of any website</p></div>
        
        <div class="guidelines">
            <h3>📖 Quick Start Guide</h3>
            <div class="guidelines-content">
                <strong>Method 1 - Website Crawler (Default):</strong><br>
                1. Go to website sitemap → Press F12 → Copy code below → Paste in console → Run<br>
                2. Download .txt file → Copy ALL contents → Paste in "Console Output" box → Click "Parse Output"<br><br>
                <strong>Method 2 - Direct URLs:</strong><br>
                • Switch to "Direct URLs" tab → Paste image URLs (one per line) → Click "Add URLs to Gallery"<br><br>
                <strong>💡 Features:</strong><br>
                • Use ← → arrow keys to navigate in popup<br>
                • Hover over filter to see ✕ delete button<br>
                • Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y for Undo/Redo<br>
                • Adjust batch size (1-3) to control computer load
                <br><br>
                <strong>🔥 Nice ka One, astiga ey! 😁😊</strong>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mode-selector">
            <button class="mode-btn active" onclick="switchMode('crawler')">🤖 Website Crawler</button>
            <button class="mode-btn" onclick="switchMode('direct')">🔗 Direct URLs</button>
        </div>
        
        <div id="crawlerMode" class="mode-panel active">
            <div class="instructions">
